WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:01.835
Har din. Sirf chabane

2
00:00:01.855 --> 00:00:03.725
mein. Kyunki kachha khaana

3
00:00:03.745 --> 00:00:05.010
... khaas kar kachha

4
00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:06.281
maas aur reshedaar phal

5
00:00:06.301 --> 00:00:07.825
... chabana mushkil hota

6
00:00:07.845 --> 00:00:09.378
hai. Aur pachana usse

7
00:00:09.398 --> 00:00:09.853
bhi mushkil.

